Password reset requested
==========================

Hello <%= @resource.first_name_or_email %>,

We received a request to change the password for your <%= @organization_name %> Portal account.

Reset your password:
<%= edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %>

This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %> and can only be used once.

If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.
No changes will be made unless you use the link above.

If you have any concerns or need assistance, please visit our Contact us page to connect with our staff:
<%= contact_us_url %>
